{"id": "zh0001", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "周一凯莉比罗伯特多收集了5个贝壳，罗伯特收集了20个，所以凯莉收集了25个。周二凯莉收集的贝壳是周一的两倍，所以她收集了50个贝壳。答案是50。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0003", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Lily 和 Amy 一共交了 70 个朋友。因为 Lily 交了 50 个，Amy 交了 2 0 个，加起来就是 7 0 个。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0005", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 29, "onset_chunk": 28, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她照顾了4个孩子，每个孩子每次赚5美元。所以总共是4乘以5，等于20美元。夹克要30美元，鞋子每双20美元，所以一共需要50美元。她已经存了10美元，再加上照顾小孩的20美元，总共就是30美元。还差20美元。修剪一次草坪可以赚4美元，所以需要修剪5次才能凑够20美元。答案是5次。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0007", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他周一睡了8小时。接下两天他各少睡了2小时，也就是每天睡6小时。那两天加起来他睡了12小时。剩下的时间他比那两天多睡1小时，也就是每天睡7小时。但题目问的是他整个星期一共睡了多少小时，而不是只算剩下的时间。所以我们只需要把周一的睡眠时间加上去。他在周一睡了8小时，所以他在整个星期一共睡了8小时。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0009", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 35, "onset_chunk": 34, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她有1,500欧元的预算。她花了1,090美元买电脑，但这个价格是美金，我们需要换算成欧元才能和预算对比。假设汇率大约是1美元等于0.93欧元，那1,090美元大约是1,013欧元。然后她又买了扫描仪、CD刻录机和打印机，分别是157欧元、74欧元和102欧元。我们把这些加起来：1,013加上157是1,170，再加74是1,244，最后加102是1,346欧元。她总共花了1,346欧元。她的预算是1,500欧元，所以还剩下1,500减去1,346等于154欧元。因此，她还有154欧元可以用来买衣服。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 56, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0011", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 24, "onset_chunk": 24, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下布林利需要在第六场考试中拿到多少分才能达到平均分93。首先，她前五场考试的分数分别是89、71、92、100和86。我们先把这五个分数加起来：89加71是160，再加92是252，再加100是352，再加86是438。所以目前总分是438。因为她会去掉最低分，也就是71，所以实际计入平均分的只有四场考试的分数。那么去掉71后，剩下三场加上第六场一共是四场。要达到平均分93，四场考试的总分应该是93乘以4，等于372。现在她去掉最低分后已经有了三个分数：89、92、100，加起来是281。那么第六场考试她需要得", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0013", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她卖掉了剩下吸尘器的一半，所以在橙房子里她卖了5除以2等于2.5台。这是不对的，因为吸尘器不能分开卖。我们需要重新考虑一下。如果她在橙房子卖掉了剩下吸尘器的一半，那么剩下的那一半就是5台。因此，在橙房子之前，她有10台吸尘器。接下来，如果她在红房子比绿房子多卖了两台，而且她在绿房子卖了三分之一，我们可以反过来算。假设绿房子卖了x台，那么红房子就卖了x加2台。但是这样算不太方便，我们换个思路。因为橙房子之前有10台，所以红房子和绿房子一共卖了10台。根据题目，红房子卖得比绿房子多2台。所以绿房子卖了4台，红房子卖了6台。因此，绿房子卖了四台，这是总吸尘器数量的三分之一。所以", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0015", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 27, "onset_chunk": 26, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "珠宝上涨2.5%的话，价值是五千乘以一加百分之二点五等于五千一百二十五美元。电子产品涨1.2%的话，八千乘以一加百分之一点二等于八千零九十六美元。那这样算下来，买电子产品赚得更多。利润就是八千零九十六减去八千等于九十六美元。所以他选择电子产品的话，本月能获得九十六美元的利润。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0017", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她借了2000美元，承诺额外还10%，那就是2000乘以0.1，等于200美元。所以总共要还2200美元。她计划每月付165美元，共12个月，12乘以165等于1980美元。那么到第12个月结束时，她已经还了1980美元。总欠款是2200美元，减去已还的1980美元，剩下220美元。所以到那时她的剩余欠款是220美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0019", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "布莱恩本来有20个电子游戏，但丢了5个，所以现在他有15个。波比的电子游戏数量是布莱恩的三倍减去5个。所以我们先算三倍的15，等于45。然后减去5，就是40。所以波比有40个电子游戏。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0021", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来一步步算一下。首先，她每小时跳跃3英里，而跑步速度是跳跃速度的两倍，所以跑步速度是6英里每小时。然后，步行速度是跑步速度的四分之一，也就是1.5英里每小时。接下来，她总共用了6个小时，其中三分之一的时间在跑步，三分之二的时间在步行。所以，跑步时间是2个小时，步行时间是4个小时。跑步2小时乘以6英里每小时，等于12英里。步行4小时乘以1.5英里每小时，等于6英里。加起来一共是18英里。所以答案是18英里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 44, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0023", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "芬看到十一只蝌蚪在池塘里游来游去。他看到六只从睡莲叶子下面游了出来，然后又看到两只躲在石头下面。这六只和两只是新出现的，之前可能没被注意到。所以现在他能看到的蝌蚪数量是十一加六再加二，等于十九。答案是十九只蝌蚪。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0025", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "首先，我们需要把单位统一起来。 4英尺等于多少英寸呢？ 1英尺有 12英寸，所以 4英尺就是 4 乘以12，等于48英寸。接下来，我们用总长度除以每段的长度：48除以6等于8。所以，她得到8段。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0027", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He wants to buy a pair of shoes that cost $ 32 and a belt for $32. So he needs to earn a total of $64. Since he makes $ 8 an hour, we can divide the total amount needed by his hourly wage: 64 divided by 8 equal s 8 hours. So, Ro rry needs to work 8 hours at his part-time job to afford both items.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0029", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他下午1点出发，下午4点返回。他每小时行驶10英里，所以总共行驶了3个小时。因此他走了30英里。然后以每小时6英里的速度返航，所以他需要5个小时才能完成这段行程。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0031", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰尼拿了20美元的零用钱然后又加了10美元所以他一共投入了30美元一年后这笔钱涨到了原来的三倍也就是30乘以3等于90美元所以一年后他有90美元", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0033", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们有20辆汽车。12辆是自动挡，4辆是手动挡。那剩下的就是半自动挡了。所以先算一下总共有多少辆半自动挡的车。20减去12再减去4，等于4。所以有4辆半自动挡的车。要算百分比的话，就是4除以20，再乘以100%。这个结果是20%。所以半自动挡汽车的百分比是20%。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0035", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "蜂巢里有700只蜜蜂。雌蜂的数量是公蜂的两倍，所以公蜂数量是雌蜂的一半。总数除以3，就是公蜂的数量。700除以3等于约233。答案是233。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0037", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 21, "onset_chunk": 20, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他们每加仑做20杯，每杯卖0.5美元，所以一加仑能赚10美元。利润是25美元，说明他们做了2.5加仑。因为25除以10等于2.5。如果一加仑需要3美元的柠檬，那么2.5加仑就需要7.5美元的柠檬。所以他们花了7.5美元买柠檬。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0039", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "凯琳达的妈妈每分钟可以拼好 2块。加起来，她们每分钟可以拼好 6块。这幅拼图有 360块，所以她们需要 60 分钟来完成。60 分钟是1小时。答案是1小时。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0041", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "雷蒙德比萨曼莎大六岁，萨曼莎31岁。那么雷蒙德就是37岁。他儿子现在23岁，那么就是用雷蒙德的年龄减去儿子的年龄。 37减23等于14。所以雷蒙德的儿子是在14年前出生的。答案就是14年。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0043", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，咱们来算一下。半打盘子是6个，每个6000美元，所以总费用就是6乘以6000，等于36000美元。二十打杯子比这少1200美元，那二十打杯子的总费用就是36000减去1200，等于34800美元。二十打杯子一共240个杯子，所以每个杯子的价格就是34800除以240，等于145美元。所以每个杯子的总费用是145美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 36, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0045", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他一年赚的金额是：2000美元乘以52周，等于104,000美元。再加上5%的加薪，也就是104,000美元的5%，也就是5,200美元。所以工资部分总共是109,200美元。另外，他还获得了5,000美元的现金奖励。因此，他这一年总共赚了114,200美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0047", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 30, "onset_chunk": 29, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "史蒂芬的最终账单是40美元，包含了25%的服务费、3美元的送货费和4美元的小费。我们来算一下：首先，这个25%的服务费是加在原价上的，所以40美元其实是原价加上25%之后的总额。设原价为X，则X加上25%的服务费等于1.25倍的X，即1.25X等于40美元。解这个方程，X等于40除以1.25，结果是32美元。所以，原价是32美元。然后再加上3美元的送货费和4美元的小费，总共是32加3加4，等于39美元。但题目", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0049", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来一步步算一下。莫尼塞特带了5个苹果和8个橙子。凯尔的苹果是莫尼塞特的两倍，也就是10个苹果。他的橙子比莫尼塞特少一半，也就是4个橙子。所以凯尔一共带了10加4等于14个水果。莫尼塞特带了5加8等于13个水果。他们俩一共就是14加13，等于27个水果。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0051", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Tommy sold 4 3 brownies and 23 cheesecake s at $4 each. To find the total, we first add the number of items: 4 3 plus 23 equals 6 6 items in total. Then, we multi ply that by $4 per item: 66 times 4 is 2 64. So, Tom my raised $ 26 4 for his charity.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0053", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 38, "onset_chunk": 32, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Debra is monitoring a be ehive to count the number of be es entering and leaving it. In the first six hours, she saw 3 0 bees leave the hive. Then, in the next six hours, she saw half that many bees return, which means 15 bees came back. Next, in the following six hours, she saw twice as many bees leave as she saw initially, so that’s 6 0 bees flying out and away. Finally, during the last six hours, all the bees that had left earlier but hadn’ t returned yet came back. So let' s add them up to find out how many bees entered and left throughout the day.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0055", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他有13套乐高，每套卖15美元。所以他的总收入是13乘以15，等于195美元。然后他买了8款游戏，每款20美元，所以游戏的总花费是8乘以20，等于160美元。再加上剩下的5美元，那么他总共花了160加5，等于165美元。他一共赚了195美元，花了165美元，所以他还剩下30美元。这30美元是他卖掉一些乐高的钱。因为每套乐高卖15美元，所以他卖了30除以15，等于2套。所以他原来有13套，卖了2套，还剩下11套乐高。答案是11套。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 43, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0057", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果米格尔每周用一叠纸，每叠有30张，那么他每周就用掉30张纸。一个月大约有4周，所以 30乘以4等于120。答案是：他每个月用掉120张纸。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0059", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "格里芬最开始有24根薯条。凯尔拿了5根，所以剩下19根。比利拿的是凯尔的两倍，也就是10根。这样格里芬就剩下9根了。金杰给了他一些薯条，我们设这个数量为X。科尔比拿的数量比凯尔少3根，凯尔拿了5根，所以科尔比拿了2根。那么最后格里芬有9加上X再减去2，等于27。也就是说7加上X等于27。所以X等于20。金杰给了格里芬20根薯条。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0061", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "杰莎20岁。琼比杰莎大5岁，所以琼是25岁。玛丽比琼小2岁，所以玛丽是23岁。把她们的年龄加起来：20加25加23。20加25等于45，45加23等于68。所以这三个女孩的年龄总和是68岁。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0063", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's figure out howmuch change Violetta will get. She needs 5different coloredcrayons, and eachone costs $2. So first, wemultiply 5 by2 to find the total cost:5 times 2is 10. That meansthe crayons cost $10 in total. Violetta has$20, sowe subtract the costfrom what she paid: 20 minus 10 is 10. Violetta will get $10 inchange.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0065", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "有4名老师，每人每天上两节课，所以一共是4乘2等于8节课。白板每节课擦3次，那么8节课就是8乘3，等于24次。所以白板每天要擦24次。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0067", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他买了10包，每包6片，一共就是60片曲奇饼。每片0.1美元，那总共就是6美元。他用10美元付款，所以找回的钱就是4美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0069", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这栋楼总共有15层，每层8个单元。先算出总单元数：15乘以8，等于120个单元。三分之四的单元有人住，那么空置的就是剩下的三分之一。120除以3等于40。所以，这栋楼没人住的单元总数是40个。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0071", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他买了12辆车，每辆车2000美元。那么车的总价是12乘以2000，等于24000美元。然后呢，他又要交10%的税，就是24000的10%，也就是2400美元。接着呢，每辆车还要加1000美元的注册费，12辆车就是12000美元。所以总共花的钱就是24000加上2400再加上12000，等于38400美元。所以马克一共花了38400美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0073", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "狗和猫的比是2比1，狗有60只，那猫就是30只。兔子比它们俩加起来少12只，一共是90只，减去12，剩78只。所以兔子有78只。总宠物数量就是狗、猫和兔子加起来，60加30再加78，等于168只。答案是168只宠物。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0075", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "先算她一共买了多少份冰淇淋。每盒有15份，60天她每天吃一份，那就是60天正好需要60份冰淇淋。一盒有15份，所以她需要 60除以15，等于4盒。每盒4美元，那么 4盒就是4乘4等于16美元。所以她在60天里买冰淇淋花了16美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0077", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "布列塔尼的妈妈给了收银员一张儿童票和一张成人票的钱。儿童票是10美元，成人票是12美元。所以她给了收银员10加12等于22美元。她收到8美元的找零，这说明她付了22美元。答案就是22美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0079", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她得拿走 15磅。每本漫画书重 4盎司，30 本就重 120 ounce。一磅是16 ounce，所以 120 ounce 是 7.5磅。她还剩下 7.5磅要减。玩具每件重半磅，也就是 8 ounce。所以她需要拿走 7.5 除以 0.5，也就是 15 件玩具。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0081", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "吉姆每晚看电视2小时，读书1小时。所以他每晚总共花3个小时在这两件事上。每周他做这三件事三次，所以每周他在这两项活动上花的时间是3小时乘以3次，等于9小时。4周就是9小时乘以4周，等于36小时。所以他在四周内花了36小时看电视和看书。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 34, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0083", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Naomi得了 68分，那她的一半就是34分。Y uri的得分比这多10分，所以是44分。Brianna比Naomi多得了17分，也就是68加17等于85分。四个人一共得了51分？这不可能啊！Naomi一个人就有68分了，怎么可能总共才51分呢？肯定哪里出错了，题目里的总分肯定写错了。如果我们算一下实际分数：Naomi 68，Yuri 44，Brianna 85，加起来已经超过51了。所以乔乔的分数肯定是负数，或者题目数据有误。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0085", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "有 36只企鹅在晒太阳，三分之一跳入海中游泳。36除以3等于12，所以有12只企鹅去游泳了。另外三分之一进入洞穴进食，也是12只企鹅。那么现在还在晒太阳的企鹅就是36减去两批离开的企鹅，也就是36减12再减12，等于12只。所以还有12只企鹅在晒太阳。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0087", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "现在水箱里有 30升水。因为她用了90升，所以剩下30升。然后她用这剩下的30升收集了两倍的雨水，也就是60升。但问题是问水箱里有多少水，所以答案是30升。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0089", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "哈利昨晚睡了9个小时。詹姆斯的睡眠时间只有哈利的2/3，那么詹姆斯睡了9乘以2除以3，也就是6个小时。哈利比詹姆斯多睡了9减去6，等于3个小时。所以答案是3。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0091", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "卡拉下载这个文件需要 100 分钟。因为这个文件是 200 MB，正常速度每分钟 2MB，所以正常情况下需要 100 分钟完成。但是在下载了 40% 的时候，Windows强制重启安装更新，花了 20 分钟。然后她必须从头开始下载。也就是说，她得再花 100 分钟来完成剩下的下载。加上那 20 分钟的重启时间，总共就是 120分钟。所以，下载这份文件总共需要 120 分钟。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0093", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们来算一下粉色口香糖球的数量。题目说粉色口香糖球的数量是蓝色的四倍还多22个。现在蓝色口香糖球有12个，那我们就先算四倍是多少。十二乘以四等于四十八。然后再加上二十二，四十八加二十二等于七十。所以粉色口香糖球一共有七十个。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0095", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 26, "onset_chunk": 25, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。杰西卡每月的最低还款额加起来是 300 加200 加 500，一共是1000美元。如果她想比最低还款额多还50%，那就是多还一半，也就是 500美元。所以她每月实际还款是 1500美元。一年有12个月，1500乘以12等于18000美元。所以杰西卡一年要还 18000美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0097", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "首先，60名精灵中，三分之一因为被涂漆而辞职。那我们来算一下三分之一是多少。60除以3等于20，所以有20个精灵因为被涂漆而辞职了。那么剩下的精灵就是60减去20，等于40个。接着，剩下的40个精灵里面，又有10个因为被踢到小腿而辞职了。所以我们再从40里面减掉这10个，就剩下30个精灵还在工作。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0099", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 25, "onset_chunk": 25, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来一步步算一下。第一个人说有 80 个。第二个人说的是第一个人的一半再加 20，那就是 80 除以 2 是40，再加上20，等于 60。第三个人说的是比第一个多 25%，也就是80 的25% 是 20，所以是100 个。现在把三个人的数加起来，80 加 60 是140，再加上 100，总共是 240。平均数就是 240 除以 3，等于 80。所以他们猜测的数量平均是 80 个。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 34, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0101", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "劳埃德第一周做了 5 个小时的家教，第二周做了 8 个小时。所以他前两周共计做了 5加 8，也就是 13 个小时。他每小时赚 10美元，所以他总共赚了 13 乘以 10，也就是 130美元。劳埃德在前两周总共挣了130美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0103", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们来看一下这道题。杰瑞有两个水池，都有缺口，两个水池都在以每分钟4加仑的速度排空。四分钟前，大水池的水量是小水池的两倍。现在，大水池的水量是小水池的四倍。问题是，小水池里现在有多少水？我们先看一下题目给出的信息。首先，两座水池都有缺口，而且都在以每分钟4加仑的速度排空。然后，四分钟前，大水池的水量是小水池的两倍。现在，大水池的水量是小水池的四倍。所以我们可以设小水池四分钟前的水量为x加仑。那么大水池四分钟前的水量就是2x加仑。因为它是小水池的两倍。然后", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0105", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 29, "onset_chunk": 29, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们来算一下机械师周四和周五分别赚了多少钱。周四他修了6个卡车轮胎，每个60美元，所以卡车轮胎收入是6乘60等于360美元。又修了4个汽车轮胎，每个40美元，所以汽车轮胎收入是4乘40等于160美元。加起来周四总共赚了360加160等于520美元。周五他只修了12个汽车轮胎，没修卡车轮胎。所以收入就是12乘40等于480美元。比较两天的收入，周四赚了520美元，周五赚了480美元。所以周四比周五多赚了40美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 59, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0107", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 27, "onset_chunk": 26, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每天吃三明治，每份三明治用两片奶酪。所以一周七天，他吃了七份三明治。7乘2等于14片奶酪。他这周有三天早餐吃煎蛋卷，每份煎蛋卷比三明治多一片奶酪，也就是三片。3乘3等于9片奶酪。他还做了一份大奶酪通心粉，放了8片奶酪。加起来就是14加9再加8，一共是31片奶酪。答案是31片。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0109", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来一步步算一下。三个人买了三张门票，总共花了 20.25美元，那每张票就是 20.25 除以 3，等于 6.75美元。食物花的钱比门票少 4.50美元，所以食物是20.25减去4.50，等于 15.75美元。然后他们玩了 12 个不同的游乐设施，每个 3.3美元，那就是 12 乘以3.3，等于 39.60美元。现在把所有费用加起来：门票20.25，食物 15.75，游乐设施 39.60，加起来一共是 75.60美元。三个人平摊的话，就是 75.60 除以 3，等于25.20美元。所以每个人要付 25.20美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0111", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "多莉有两本书，潘多拉有一本。如果她们都读对方的书和自己的书，那么每个人都会读三本书：自己的一本，多莉的两本中的一本，以及潘多拉的一本。所以，多莉读三本，潘多拉也读三本。加起来一共是六本书。答案是六本。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0113", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 36, "onset_chunk": 35, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "第一队每名队员跑400米需要55秒，所以整支队伍跑完4乘以400米需要220秒。第二队第一名选手用60秒跑完，后面每个人比前一个快3秒，所以第二名用57秒，第三名用54秒，第四名用51秒。加起来一共是222秒。这样算下来，第二队比第一队多用了2秒。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0115", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 34, "onset_chunk": 33, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来一步一步算一下。首先，戴夫吃了14根薯条。海鸥吃掉的数量是戴夫的一半，所以海鸥吃了 14 除以 2，等于 7根。接着，三只鸽子每只吃了 3根，总共就是 3 乘以3，等于9根。然后浣熊偷走了剩下薯条的三分之二。蚂蚁拿走最后一根，留下 5根。那我们从最后往前推吧。先看浣熊之前剩下多少。因为浣熊偷了三分之二，剩下的五根就是总数的三分之一。所以这五根加上浣熊吃的三分之二，合起来就是一整包。所以在浣熊吃之前，剩下的部分应该是 5 乘以 3，等于 15根。再往前，鸽子吃了 9根，所以在这之前还剩15 加", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0117", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下。总共有25颗橙子。题目说有1颗坏的，20%是不熟的，也就是5颗，还有2颗是酸的。那么这三类加起来就是1加5加2，一共8颗。所以剩下的好的橙子就是25减8，等于17颗。答案是17颗好的橙子。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0119", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。学校礼堂里一共有1000名学生。30%的学生从A出口出去了，那就是1000乘以30%，也就是300人。剩下的学生是1000减去300，等于700人。接着，这700人中有三分之五从B出口出去了，也就是700乘以三分之五，大约是467人。所以，从C出口出去的学生人数就是剩下的700减去467，等于233人。答案是233人从C出口出去了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 42, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0121", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每天花0.5小时照顾每条狗的饮食和遛狗。他有10条狗，所以每天总共需要 0.5乘以10等于5小时。一周有7天，所以每周总共是5乘以7等于35小时。因此，约翰每周要花35小时来照顾这些狗。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0123", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "她从23岁开始，每年度假4次，每次都拿一件T恤当拼布用。现在34岁，所以她已经做了11年的这种习惯。每年4件T恤，11年就是4乘11等于44块拼布。所以她现在有44片被子拼布。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0125", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's break it downstepbystep. First, thedoughnuts: three dozen at$68per dozen means3 times 68 is $204. Next, themini cupcakes: two dozenat $80 per dozen equals 2 times 80, which is$160. Then, the minicheesecakes: sixdozenat $55 perdozen adds up to6 times55, whichis $330. Now, let's add themall together: 204 plus 160 gives us364, and then adding 330brings the totalto $694. So, Tula spenta total of $694onall thepastries.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 58, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0127", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来算一下。首先看周一、周三和周五这三天，他每天有三节一小时的课，那每天就是3小时乘以3节课，等于9小时。然后周二和周四，他每天有两节两小时的课，所以每天是2小时乘以2节，等于4小时。加起来一周总共是9加4，再乘以3天和2天，也就是9乘3加4乘2，算出来是一周总共27小时。一个学期有16周，那就是27乘以16，等于432小时。所以在一个学期里，基莫一共要上432小时的课。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 47, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0129", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。他原来有 30张火系、20张草系和40张水系，总共是90张卡牌。然后他丢了8张水系，所以水系就变成了32张。再加上他买了14张草系，但草系不影响水系的数量。所以现在水系还是32张。那么随机抽一张是水系的概率就是32除以90，大概是0.355，四舍五入到最接近的整数就是36%。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0131", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "安迪种了90株天竺葵。矮牵牛花比天竺葵少40株，所以是90减去40等于50株矮牵牛花。加起来一共是90加50等于140株。所以安迪一共种了140株花。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0133", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 30, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "比利正在为他的大型家庭团聚烧烤会制作土豆沙拉。这是一场盛大的活动，所以他得完成60颗土豆。土豆都差不多大小，所以用时大约1分半钟。但将一颗土豆削皮切块只需大约5秒，比利准备好这些土豆需要多长时间呢？", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0135", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "乔的万圣节糖果包里有 25根巧克力棒，每颗糖子苹果的重量是80。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0137", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "塞西莉", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0139", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "吉恩有 30根棒棒糖，吃掉了2根，那剩下就是28根。他想每包装2根，所以用28除以2，结果是14包。所以吉恩能装14包。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0141", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 29, "onset_chunk": 29, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay, let's breakthis down step bystep. First,Jay earns $6000 a month. Hespends 1/4on rent,so that's 6000 dividedby 4, which is$1500 for rent.Then hespends 1/3 ongas, sothat's 6000 divided by3, which is $2000 for gas.Now,let'sadd those twoexpenses:1500 plus2000equals 3500. Sofar, hespent 3500 out of 6000. Thatleaveshim with 6000 minus 3500, which is2500 left.Next,he donates halfof his remainingincome to charity.Halfof 25", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0143", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "两双高跟鞋的总价是33美元加66美元，也就是99美元。而这比靴子的价格少5美元，所以靴子的价格就是104美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0145", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's figure out how much Vincent can save by buying the flowers at a better price. First, if he buys the 3-bou quet packs for $2. 50 each, to get 18 flowers, he needs 6 pack s because 18 divided by 3 is 6. That would cost him 6 times $2. 50, which is $ 15. If he buys the individual bouquets for $ 1 each, he needs 18 of them, so that would cost him $1 8. The difference between $ 18 and $ 15 is $3. So, Vi ncent can save $3 by buying the 18 flowers at the better price.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0147", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 27, "onset_chunk": 26, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "马克每句编辑5美分，所以对于他每周编辑的1000个句子，他从出版商甲那里赚得1000乘以5，等于5000美分。出版商乙付给他的钱是出版商甲的两倍，所以他从出版商乙那里赚得2000美分。因此，马克每周总共赚得5000加2000，等于7000美分。答案是B。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0149", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 18, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "亨利的旅行总长是60英里。他第一次停下来的时候已经骑了20英里，第二次停下来是在离终点还有15英里的时候。所以第二次停车时，他已经骑了60减去15等于45英里。那么从第一次停车到第二次停车之间，他骑了45减去20等于25英里。所以答案是25英里。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0151", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "根据你提供的信息，索达市的总人口是 23,786 人，其中男性有 8,417 人，女性有 9,92人。我们可以先算出成年人口总数：8,417 加上 9,920，等于 18,337 人。然后用总人口减去成年人数：23,786 -18,337 = 5,449。所以，索达市大约有 5,449 名儿童。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0153", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "先算第一天的自行车总数。两个集装箱，每个有5辆自行车，那第一天一共是10辆。第二天码头上总共有30辆自行车。所以第二天新进来的自行车数量是30减去第一天的10，等于20辆。因为每个集装箱装5辆，所以第二天进口的集装箱数就是20除以5，等于4个。答案是4个集装箱。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0155", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，咱们一步步来。这幅拼图一共有1000片。波比先拼了四分之一，那就是1000除以4，等于250片。所以还剩1000减去250，也就是750片没拼。然后他妈妈又拼了剩下拼片的三分之一，三分之一乘以750，等于250片。所以现在还剩750减去250，也就是500片。答案是500片。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0157", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 25, "onset_chunk": 24, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Candice started with 80 sticky notes.She used onesticky note percoffee cup, and therewere 20 coffeecups. Soshe used 20 sticky notes atwork. That means she had80 minus 20, which is 60 sticky notes leftbefore buying the pack.Afterbuying the pack, shehad 23 sticky notes left.So to find outhow many were in the pack,we subtract the final amount fromthe amount beforebuying: 60 minus 23 equals 37. Thepack contained37 sticky notes.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0159", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "前三个顾客各买了一张 DVD，所以是3 个。后面两位顾客各买了两张 DVD，所以是2 乘以 2，等于4 个。最后三位顾客没有购买任何 DVD，所以是0 个。把这些加起来，3加4 加 0，等于 7。所以 Billy在周二卖出了 7 个 DVD。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0161", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每天产252颗蛋，一周有7天。所以每周总共能产 252乘以 7，也就是 1764颗蛋。一打有 12颗蛋，所以 1764除以 12，等于 147打。他每打卖 20美元，那么 147 乘以 20，就是 2940美元。所以莱德每周从鸡蛋赚 2940美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0163", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我们来一步步算。波有40只螃蟹。莫妮克比波少4只，所以莫妮克有36只。拉尼比莫妮克多10只，所以拉尼有46只。加起来一共是40加36加46，等于122。三个人一共拥有122只螃蟹。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0165", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他买了38根鸡肉肠，比鸡肉肠多买了6根鱼肠。那我们就用38加上6，等于44。所以迪伦一共买了44根香肠。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0167", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "乔西有10英亩的农场。每英亩每年产出5吨葡萄。所以总共产出 10乘以5，等于50吨葡萄。每吨葡萄能做出2桶葡萄酒。那么50吨葡萄就能做出 50乘以2，等于100桶葡萄酒。所以她的农场每年能产出100桶葡萄酒。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0169", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "第一个月下载了60次。第二个月是第一个月的三倍，也就是180次。第三个月减少了30%，那就是比第二个月少了54次，所以第三个月下载了126次。加起来一共是60加180加126，等于366次。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0171", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他种了3个玫瑰丛，每个有25颗玫瑰，所以总共有75颗玫瑰。每颗玫瑰有8根刺，所以总共有600根刺。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0173", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "李过去完成400米跨栏的速度跑比杰拉尔德快2秒，但杰拉德的饮食习惯改变后使他的速度提高了", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0175", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 28, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It's true that cars can be stuck in traffic for long periods of time, but there are also situations where cars move through the traffic quickly and efficiently. For example, during rush hour or peak travel times when road s are heavily congest ed, some vehicles may only need to wait a short period before they can proceed. This is often due to efficient traffic flow management, lane usage, or specific driving behavior s that allow certain cars to bypass the congestion. So, while it's common for some cars to get stuck, others can navigate through the traffic relatively quickly.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0177", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰有三个箱子，每个箱子的尺寸是 5英寸乘6英寸乘4英寸。我们先算一个箱子的体积，就是长宽高的乘积。5乘6等于30，再乘4等于120立方英寸。所以一个箱子的体积是120立方英寸。三个箱子加起来就是 120乘3等于360立方英寸。箱子的尾板厚度不影响内部内容物的总体积，所以只用算箱子本身的容积就行。答案是360立方英寸。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0179", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "She uses 3 eggs per day. That's 3 times 7, or 21 eggs per week. There are 4 weeks in the month. So she' s going to eat 21 times 4, which is 8 4 eggs total. Since there are 12 eggs in a dozen, we divide that by 12. And she'll use 7 dozen eggs over the course of four weeks.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0181", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他倒了 500块乐高，这是第一套。第二套比这多三倍，也就是 3 乘以500，等于 1500块。第三套是第二套的四分之一，也就是 1500 除以 4，等于 375块。加起来一共是500 加 1500 加375，总共是2375块。所以约翰尼得捡起 2375块乐高。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0183", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's start by figuring out how old D arlene and Aaron are right now. The ratio of their ages is 7 to 1 1, which means if we let Darlene be 7 parts, Aaron would be 11 parts. So together, they make up 7 plus 11, which is 18 parts in total. We know that the sum of their current ages is 1 62, so each part must equal 1 62 divided by 18, which gives us 9 years per part. Now, since Aaron is 1 1 parts, his age is 11 times 9, so he is currently 99 years old. To find out how old he will be in 1 0 years, we just add 10 to his current age, which makes it 10 9. So, Aaron will be 109 years old in 10 years.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 42, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0185", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每公顷有100棵菠萝，总共10公顷。所以总共是1000棵菠萝。一年有4个三个月，也就是四次收割。那么一年能收割 4000棵菠萝。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0187", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 28, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "After one month, Eli an had 20 cards.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0189", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，我们来一步步算一下。白宝箱里有 175颗钻石。红宝石比钻石少 35颗，所以是 175减去 35，等于 140颗红宝石。绿宝石的数量是红宝石的两倍，也就是140乘以 2，等于 280颗绿宝石。最后把三种宝石加起来：175加 140加280，结果是 695颗宝石。所以，白宝箱里总共有 695颗宝石。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 37, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0191", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "苏西的 iPhone 用了一年，本的是它的两倍旧，所以本的用了两年。布兰登的是本的三倍旧，所以他的用了六年。答案是六年。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0193", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果200磅胡萝卜要分给40家餐厅，每家餐厅收到2磅，那么总用掉的胡萝卜是40乘以2等于80磅。所以不会用到的胡萝卜就是200减去80，等于120磅。答案是120磅。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0195", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果一袋薯片有 5 份，每份含250kcal，那么整袋薯片总共是1250kcal。你的日目标是 2000kcal，已经吃了1800kcal，所以剩下最多还能吃 200kcal。这些卡路里能占整袋薯片的 1/6。因为一袋薯片是 300克，所以你可以再吃大约50克薯片。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0197", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "世界上剩下27只独角兽，三分之一在苏格兰高地。那苏格兰高地的独角兽就是 27除以3等于9只。这个苏格兰高地的独角兽里，三分之二是雌性，那就用9乘以三分之二，结果是6。所以苏格兰雌性独角兽有6只。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0199", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "比赛中共有40名亚洲人参赛，其中80名是日本人。这里有个问题啊，总人数才40人，怎么会有80名日本人呢？这显然是不可能的，所以这道题数据有矛盾，没法算出答案。如果按正常逻辑来理解的话，应该是40名亚洲人参赛，其中部分是日本人，剩下的才是中国人。但题目写成了80名日本人，这就超过总人数了，所以无法计算中国队的女性队员数量。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0201", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Let's say they won W games and lost L games. We know that W plus L equals 2 2 because there are only wins or losses in total. And we also know that W equal s L plus 8, since they won eight more than they lost. So if we replace W with L plus 8 in the first equation, we get L plus 8 plus L equal s 2 2. That means 2L plus 8 equal s 22. Sub tract ing 8 from both sides gives us 2L equal s 14. D iv iding by 2 tells us L equal s 7. So they lost seven games. Now to find out how many they won, we just add 8 to that number of losses. Seven plus eight is fifteen. Therefore the team won fifteen matches.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 44, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0203", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Jenny has a stack of letters that need stamp s and another stack that are already stamped. She starts by st amping one-third of the letters that need stamps. After she does this, there are 3 0 letters in the already stamp ed pile. We want to find out how many letters were in the un stamped pile before she started. So if 3 0 is what's left after she stamp s one-third, that means two-thir ds of the original un stamped letters equal 30. To find the total, we can divide 3 0 by two and then multiply by three. That gives us 15 times 3, which is 45. So there were originally 4 5 letters in the unstamp ed pile.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 36, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0205", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "两年后，赛特和布鲁克的年龄总和为28岁。如果现在他们的年龄总和是x岁，那么我们有x加2等于28。解这个方程，我们得出x等于26。所以现在赛特和布鲁克的年龄总和是26岁。设布鲁克的年龄为B，则赛特的年龄为2倍的B。因此，我们有B加上2B等于26。这意味着3倍的B等于26。解这个方程，我们得出B等于约等于8.67岁。由于年龄通常用整数表示，我们可以四舍五入到最接近的整数，即9岁。所以布鲁克大约9岁，赛特大约18岁。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 54, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0207", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "1 5天里有3 0天，所以莱恩每天种60朵花。然后他有15天没长出5朵花，所以他会少7 5朵花。所以他总共会有52 5朵花。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0209", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 26, "onset_chunk": 25, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "马克昨天有八小时的时间来完成这场由七十五道题组成的测验，他每小时可以完成五道题。所以八小时他总共能做四十道题，因为 8 乘以 5 是40。但是他只有七十五道题，所以他做完了所有的题目，没有什么题目是未做的。今天的测验则不一样了。今天他只有六小时的时间来完成一百道题。如果他保持每小时五道题的速度，那么在六小时内他只能做三十道题，因为 6 乘以 5 是30。但是这场测验有一百道题，所以他只完成了其中的三十道。因此，他还有七十道题没有作答。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 45, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0211", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 30, "onset_chunk": 30, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "基础卷饼是6.50美元。他加了2.00美元的肉，1.00美元的奶酪，1.00美元的牛油果，还有两份酱汁，每份0.25美元，也就是0.50美元。那这些加起来就是 6.50 加 2.00 是 8.50，再加1.00 是 9.50，再加1.00 是 10.50，再加 0.50 是 11.00美元。然后他还升级了餐点，多花了3.00美元买薯条和饮料。所以总共是 11.00 加 3.00，等于 14.00美元。他有一张5.00美元的礼品卡，可以用在结账时。所以实际支付金额就是14.00减去5.00，等于9.00美元。因此，他需要支付9.00美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0213", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 25, "onset_chunk": 25, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "玛丽一共有 40 个窗台，每个窗台已经有两盆盆栽植物，所以她总共有 40 乘以 2，也就是 80 个盆栽植物。昨天她又从苗圃收到 18盆新的盆栽植物，那么她现在总共有的盆栽植物就是 80 加上18，等于 98 个盆栽植物。今天她打算从每个窗台上拿走一盆盆栽送给朋友和家人，也就是一共送出40 个盆栽植物。所以最后玛丽还剩下 98 个减去 40，也就是58 个盆栽植物。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0215", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 19, "onset_chunk": 19, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果Marc在同一家公司工作了40年，他能获得每年5,000美元的年度养老金。从20年后开始，他有权获得每年养老金价值的5%。如果他在30年后辞职，那时他的年度退休金是多少？", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0217", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰给三个孩子各买了两双鞋，每双鞋60美元。那他总共买了 3 乘以 2，就是 6双鞋。每双鞋60美元，6双就是 360美元。所以约翰一共支付了 360美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0219", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "从下午1点到下午5点，一共是4小时。每小时蜡烛熔化2厘米，所以4小时就会熔化8厘米。答案是8厘米。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0221", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 35, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "苏住在一个有趣的街区，有个周末，邻居们决定对苏恶作剧。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
