{"id": "zh0225", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "第一天有100位顾客。第二天比第一天多了50%，也就是多了50人，所以第二天来了150人。前两天加起来一共是250人。到第三天为止总人数是500，那第三天就得再进来250人。所以第三天有250位顾客到店。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0227", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So we assume that Seattle has 2", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0229", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If the winner got 3/4 of the votes, then they got 3/ 4 times 80, which is 60 vote s. The total number of students who voted was 80. So the loser got 8 0 minus 60, which is 20. So the answer is 2 0.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0231", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 33, "onset_chunk": 32, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰开车三小时，每小时60英里，所以他总共行驶了180英里。因为3乘以 60等于180。然后他掉头往回走，想尽快到家。但是前两个小时都堵在路上了。那么接下来的一半小时，也就是半小时，他以每小时30英里的速度行驶，所以这半小时他行驶了15英里。因为0.5乘以30等于15。所以从家出发后，他总共", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0233", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "约翰买了蓝色领带，每条40美元，总共花了200美元。那我们先算他买了多少条蓝色领带。200除以40等于5条。所以他买了5条蓝色领带。题目说他买的红色领带是蓝色的两倍，那就是10条红色领带。接着看价格，红色领带比蓝色贵50%，蓝色40美元，加50%就是60美元。所以每条红色领带60美元，10条就是600美元。最后把红蓝领带的钱加起来，200加600等于800美元。所以约翰总共花了800美元买领带。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0235", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 17, "onset_chunk": 16, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "She bought 4 cakes on Monday. On Tuesday, she bought three times that amount, so 3 times 4 is 12. Then on Wednesday, she bought five times the number she bought on Tuesday, which means 5 times 12 is 60. So adding them up: 4 plus 12 is 1 6, and 16 plus 60 is 7 6. Lucy bought a total of 7 6 cake s over the three days.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0237", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "你有十升橙汁饮料，其中三分之二为水。这意味着橙汁饮料中含有 2/3×10 = 6.67升水。但你在倒饮料时洒掉了 1升橙汁，所以剩下的橙汁量是 10 - 1= 9升。因此，剩下的橙汁饮料中含有 2/3 ×9 =6升水。所以在 9升剩下的橙汁饮料中含有6升水。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0239", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他每天上午打 5桶，下午打 6桶，所以一共是11桶。每桶有 5升水，那么 11桶就是 11乘以 5，等于 55升。所以巴尔德尔每天总共获得 55升水。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0241", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "12 0个西瓜， 3 0%已经可以摘了。 1 20 乘以 30%等于 3 6个西瓜被带走了。所以剩下的西瓜是 12 0减去 36 ，等于 8 4个。两周后剩下的西瓜中有三分之四熟了。三分之四是 8 4的 4 除 以 3，大约是 1 12。但只有 84个，所以我们用 84乘以 4再除 以 3，得到 1 1 2。不，这不对。应该是 8 4乘以 4再除以 3，", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0243", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "鸡肉饭是12美元。5盒牛奶每盒3美元，所以牛奶总共是 15美元。4个苹果每个 1.5美元，一共是6美元。我们把这三项加起来，12加15再加6，等于33美元。Marie总共付了50美元，那剩下的钱就是披萨的费用。50减去33等于17美元。每盒披萨8.5美元，用17除以8.5，结果是2。所以Marie订购了2盒披萨。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 34, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0245", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So for the first three hours, he runs at 1 0 miles per hour. That means in those three hours, he covers 30 miles because 1 0 times 3 is 30. After that, he slows down to 5 miles per hour. Now we have four more hours left since it was seven total hours. At 5 miles an hour for four hours, he runs another 2 0 miles because 5 times 4 is 2 0. Add the two parts together: 3 0 plus 20 equals 5 0 miles. So in seven hours, Ros ae can run a total of 5 0 miles.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0247", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 32, "onset_chunk": 31, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好，我们来算一下。首先，仓鼠分到了10个笼子，每只5根菊苣，所以仓鼠一共用了10乘以5，等于50根菊苣。兔子用了20根菊苣。那老鼠和仓鼠加起来已经用了50加20，是70根菊苣。总共有160根菊苣，减去这70根，剩下的90根就是给老鼠的。因为每只老鼠分到6根菊苣，所以老鼠一共有90除以6，等于15只。这15只老鼠被关在3个笼子里，所以每个笼子里的老鼠数量是15除以3，等于5只。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0249", "pool": "zh-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "先算一支铅笔和一块橡皮擦的总价。1.20加0.30等于1.50美元。所以钢笔的价格是1.50美元。八根钢笔就是8乘以1.50，等于12.00美元。答案是12.00美元。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0251", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "那女人戴上墨镜更可能是因为阳光很大。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
