{"id": "zh0255", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The more likely outcome is A, audience amaz ed by the performance. While B could happen in a circus act, it is risk y and not typical ly what happens during a planned stunt. Ma ze artists usually focus on impressive but controlled moves that keep the audience engaged without putting themselves or others in danger. So, while flying from the air sounds exciting, it is unlikely to be part of a normal performance.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
