{"id": "zh0279", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "过山车从陡坡上速降下来，更可能的结果是乘客们尖叫着。因为下坠的速度很快，加上高度变化带来的刺激感，大家通常会感到紧张或兴奋，从而发出叫声。虽然有些人可能会笑，但整体反应通常是惊叫或呼喊。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0281", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most likely reason is that he had a stroke. Strokes can affect the brain areas responsible for speech, leading to difficulties or complete loss of speaking ability. While taking a deep breath might temporarily disrupt speech, it would not typically cause permanent loss of the ability to speak. So A is more plausible in this context.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0283", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most likely reason is that it's fragile. Using bubble wrap helps protect delicate items from damage during shipping or handling. While size can sometimes affect packaging, the main purpose of bubble wrap is to provide cushioning and prevent break age. So even if an item is small, it might still be wrapped in bubble wrap if it' s easily broken.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0285", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的结果是她把文件撕碎了。因为翻阅报纸通常会导致纸张损坏，而且在翻页时很容易弄坏或撕破纸张。虽然被纸划伤也有可能，但不如撕碎来得常见。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0287", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的结果是她撞上了篱笆。因为自行车失控了，人通常会失去对方向的控制，而篱笆离路边比较近，所以更容易撞到它。松开车把的情况虽然可能，但不一定就是失控时的直接结果。所以选A更合理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0289", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you light a match, the most likely result is that it produces a flame. So the answer is B: The match creates a flame.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0291", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是她喜欢他。因为送礼物通常表示好感或者关心，尤其是在情人节这样的日子，人们会互相表达爱意。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0293", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是地板不平。桌子摇晃通常是因为支撑它的表面有高低不平，导致重心失衡。而地板很滑主要影响的是摩擦力，可能会让桌子容易移动或者打滑，但不一定会导致明显的摇晃。所以地板不平更可能是造成摇晃的原因。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0295", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "B,其他国家的领导人送去了紧急救援。这个结果更合乎情理，因为一个国家遭受自然灾害时，通常会得到国际社会的援助和支援。另外一国家的领导人结盟的可能性较小，除非灾害导致了直接的政治影响或利益关系变化。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0297", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Given the context, it's more likely thatthe man is sad becausehis wifeleft him. Whilehaving a baby canbe stressful or challenging,itoften bringsjoy rather than sadness.Ifsomeone feelsdeeply sad, especiallyina relationship context,it usually suggests a significantloss like separation or divorce. Therefore, optionB is more plausible.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
