{"id": "zh0301", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "老师撕毁了这位学生的试卷，更可能的原因是他抓住了这位学生作弊。虽然学生的答案是错误的也可能导致试卷被撕毁，但如果只是答案错，通常老师会批改并打分，而不是直接撕掉。而如果发现学生作弊，老师很可能会立即撕毁试卷以防止证据被隐藏或销毁。所以答案A更合理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0303", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "根据你的描述，更可能的原因是A。你说失去了耐心，通常是因为等待时间太长或受到干扰。如果你的朋友一直让你等，这种持续的等待很容易让人感到焦虑和不耐烦。而朋友准时到达通常不会导致失去耐心，反倒会让人感到安心。所以，答案应该是A：我的朋友一直让我等着。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0305", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的结果是A，恳求她再次接受他。分手后，通常人们会感到伤心，而最直接的情感反应就是想挽回关系。B选项把女朋友介绍给父母，这个步骤一般是在确立关系之后才会做的事，所以在刚分手时不太可能发生。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0307", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "根据你提供的信息，更可能的结果是他看起来更年轻。因为整形手术通常旨在改善外观或恢复年轻时的样子，而非让人变老。所以，如果一个人做了整形手术，最可能的情况是他看起来更年轻了。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0309", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我咬了桃子，更可能的结果是桃子坏了，果汁溅出来了。因为咬东西时如果没咬准或者桃子比较软，就容易挤出果汁。所以选 A 更合理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0311", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "As the crowd gets larger, it's more likely that the father will hold his son's hand.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0313", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most likely reason is that the battery has died. Even if you plugged it in, sometimes it takes a few minutes for the laptop to start charging or power on fully. Try waiting a bit longer before checking again.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0315", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是她爬上了一根绳子。因为手起水泡通常是因为摩擦或者用力过猛，而爬绳子时手会抓着绳子滑动，这种摩擦很容易导致皮肤磨出水泡。打信封则不太可能造成这种情况。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0317", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的结果是B，白蚁吃穿了房子里的木头。因为白蚁以木头为食，一旦它们侵入房子，通常会在木材内部蛀食，导致结构损坏。虽然有时可能会被消灭或驱赶，但如果不及时处理，它们往往会持续造成破坏。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0319", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "She was hitting the boy because she was attracted to him.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0321", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If the economy goes down, it' s more likely that many people will lose their jobs. So the answer is B: Many people are laid off.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0323", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The more likely outcome of government oppression is that citizens will rise up in rebellion. When people are denied basic rights and freedoms, when their voices are ignored or silenced, the natural response often turns to resistance. People seek change, and if peaceful means fail, conflict may follow. While voting is important, it can be limited under oppressive regimes, making rebel lion a more realistic reaction to sustained mist reatment.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0325", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "乐队演奏了他们的热门歌曲，观众会跟着音乐拍手。毕竟大家喜欢听热门歌曲时通常会兴奋起来并加入歌唱或拍手。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0327", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If it's raining heavily, the most likely result would be A: the storm intensifies. This is because heavy rain often means the weather system is getting stronger. The other option, B: I rush in, doesn't really follow from the situation described. It might happen, but it' s not a direct outcome of the rain itself.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0329", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果一个人的头撞了一下，那更可能得脑震荡。因为头撞了一下，就有可能受到撞击，导致脑震荡或者轻微脑损伤。而陷入沉思通常是自己在想事情，跟头被撞没有关系。所以答案是他得了脑震荡。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0331", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you bake an apple pie, the most likely result is B: The kitchen is filled with a warm aroma. When you bake something like an apple pie, it usually smells really nice and warm, not rotten. So A doesn't make sense because baking shouldn' t make things stink.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0333", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He is more likely to have received the scholarship because of his academic performance. While being respect ed by classmates can be a positive factor, schol arships are typically awarded based on academic achievement, such as grades or other measurable accomplishment s. Therefore, his good grades make it the most likely reason for receiving the scholarship.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0335", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "火车上的乘客奇怪地看着他，更可能的原因是他在自言自语。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0337", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "狗看着桌上多只的牛排，更可能的结果是它流口水。因为牛排对狗来说是很诱人的食物，看到美食时狗通常会流口水。而躺下更多是放松或休息的表现，和看到食物的关系不大。所以答案应该是A：它流口水。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0339", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The office is closed. That' s probably because it's a holiday or summer vacation. Both options could make sense, but holidays are usually more specific and planned ahead of time. So the most likely reason is that it's a holiday.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0341", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "客户批准了建筑师的大楼计划，这意味着他们对设计表示认可。通常来说，如果客户批准计划，建筑师就会根据这个方案开始建造大楼。因此，更可能的结果是建筑师建造了这座建筑。当然，如果过程中发现问题或有新需求，也可能会调整计划，但批准本身意味着可以继续施工。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0343", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He place s a bet and returns home broke.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0345", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我觉得更可能是A。我要求与主管谈话。因为在工作场合，如果同事挂断了你的电话，通常是因为你提出了某种让他们不舒服的要求，比如说你直接要求找主管谈话，这可能会让对方觉得压力很大或者不舒服。而B选项提供身份证号码虽然也有可能导致挂断，但通常不会像A那样引起强烈的反应。所以综合来看，A的可能性更大。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0347", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "根据你说的，划痕很深，更可能的结果是留下疤痕。所以正确答案应该是B。因为深划痕通常会损伤皮肤深层，愈合后容易留下疤痕。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0349", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If a girl smell s something burning, it' s more likely that she left the cookies in the oven too long. So the answer is B. She probably forgot about them while they were baking and they got burned.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0351", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "交通灯变黄了，更可能的结果是司机踩了刹车。因为黄灯意味着红灯即将亮起，司机通常会减速或停车以遵守交规。按喇叭则不太符合常理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0353", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "我从窗户离开卧室，更可能是因为房子着火了。因为如果房子着火了，人通常会通过窗户逃生。而且火灾时，门窗可能会被迫打开或破坏。但如果房子是空的，那就不需要离开卧室了，所以这个理由不太合理。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0355", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的结果是树枝烧焦了。因为篝火已经燃起，扔进去的树枝会被火焰点燃并燃烧掉。火熄灭才不太可能发生，因为往篝火里加东西通常会增强火势。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0357", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I opened the fan, and more likely than not, you felt a cool breeze on your skin. Fans blow air, so they make you feel cooler when it's hot. The other option— water splashing on your skin— that usually happens with water or spray, not just turning on a fan. So yeah, feeling that cool wind is the most likely result.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0359", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think it'smore likely that youare hungry.If you are hungry, yourbody will often tell youso by sending signalsto remind you toeat. However, ifyou have been busy with work,you may not have had timeto eat properly oreven remember whenyou last ate. Therefore,if you suddenlyfeel hungry, itmay be because youhave forgotten the time and missedmeals. So,the answer is B.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0361", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "你的车抛锚了，更可能的结果是 B：我给一个机械师打了电话。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
