{"id": "zh0369", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是你踩到了这个虫子。因为如果你喷了驱虫剂，可能会让虫子逃跑或者死掉，但不会被压扁。而你踩到它时，会直接把它压扁。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0371", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "更可能的原因是A，我收到了好消息。因为表情亮起来通常代表开心或兴奋，这与收到好消息相符。而失去耐心通常会导致负面情绪，不太可能让人显得高兴。所以答案应该是A。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0373", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "如果你呼出时看到自己的呼吸，更可能的原因是天气很冷。因为在寒冷环境中，呼出的湿热空气会迅速冷却并凝结成可见的水汽。而胸部紧绷与呼吸可见性没有直接关系。所以答案是 A。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0375", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "那女人取消了她的信用卡账户，更可能是因为她意识到卡过期了。虽然丢失信用卡也会导致取消账户，但通常情况下，人们会直接挂失而不是取消整个账户。而且题干中没有提到卡丢失的情况。所以，更合理的解释是她发现卡已经过期了，于是主动取消了账户。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0377", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Given the contextof a controversialdecision being upheldby the court, itis more likely thatthere would bea stir of protests or demonstrationsoutside the court.Peoplemight gather to expresstheir disapproval or support forthe ruling. So optionA seems moreplausible than optionB, which involvesa couple exchangering vows at the courthouse entrance.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0379", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "该男子减了肥，更可能的结果是人们称赞他。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0381", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most likely result is that he passed the test.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0383", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Given the student is procrastinating on their paper, it' s more likely that they will submit an incomplete document. Procrastination often leads to rushed work or missing important sections due to lack of time, making option B more probable than A.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0385", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you drank hot coffee, the most likely result is that you burned your tongue. Hot liquid can cause burns when it comes into contact with mucous osa tissues like those in the mouth. While you might feel a moment ary sting or pain from the heat, this usually leads to tissue damage consistent with burning. So option B is more probable than A.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0387", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "他踩在碎玻璃上。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0389", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you re filled the bottle, it's most likely because you drank all the water in it. So the answer is A.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0391", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "She likely learned communication skills. While she might pick up some vocabulary, the primary benefit of joining a debate team is developing strong argumentation and communication abilities.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0393", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "这夫妇签了公寓租约，更可能的结果是他们搬进了公寓。签租约通常意味着双方同意住进去并按约定交租金。虽然有些情况下租约会被终止或取消，但一般情况下签了租约就等于开始入住。至于市政府把公寓判为危房，这跟夫妇签不签租约没有直接关系。所以答案选A：这对夫妇搬进了公寓。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0395", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If the pen ran out of ink, you're more likely to grab a pencil instead. So, A is correct. You use a pencil and sign your name with it. The other option isn ’t really relevant here.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "zh0397", "pool": "zh-causal", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So the most likely outcome is B, they negotiate a peace treaty. When countries are at war and then decide to pursue peace, their main goal is usually to end the conflict through negotiation s rather than continuing to develop weapons. While developing nuclear weapons might happen in some situations, it's not typically the direct result of seeking peace. The focus would be on finding agreement s that allow both sides to live without fighting.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
